// The single wide character, as its own contract.
//
// spikes/echo.idl carries a wstring and no wchar, and every fixture in the
// tree implements echo.idl — so until this file existed the GIOP 1.1 `wchar`
// (two octets, no length indication, nowhere to put a mark) had never met a
// peer in either direction. Adding the operation to echo.idl would have
// touched every fixture; a second, two-operation contract touches only the
// fixtures that exist to measure it: spikes/jacorb/WideServer.java,
// spikes/jacorb/WideClient.java and spikes/jacorb_wchar11.py, driven by
// spikes/jacorb_wchar11.sh.
//
// *echo.idl에는 wstring만 있고 wchar가 없어서, 1.1 wchar는 어느 방향으로도
// 피어를 만난 적이 없었다. 이 계약은 그 한 문자를 재기 위해서만 존재한다.*
module spike {
  //@ ai_desc: Wide-character echo used to measure wchar and wstring codeset paths
  interface Wide {
    //@ ai_desc: Returns the wide character it was given, unchanged
    //@ ai_effect: read_only
    wchar   echo_wchar(in wchar c);
    //@ ai_desc: Returns the wide string it was given, unchanged
    //@ ai_effect: read_only
    wstring echo_wstring(in wstring s);
  };
};
